Notebook[{
Cell["Hormiga de Langton", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"bdccf37d-0fc5-43a6-a406-8cb76743335b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Simulaci\[OAcute]n directa de una hormiga de Langton generalizada, no como \
aut\[OAcute]mata celular. La regla es una cadena con una letra por color: ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["R",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"345fa112-f5f5-4e41-9eda-8c4073202f37"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"bb40e07a-74de-4acc-9575-3280373c63db"],
 " gira a la derecha, ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["L",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"5ee4722b-2f57-4ebc-b463-f2c97943e0df"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"9975ebf5-96a6-46e1-80c3-d6bdc78aa7a7"],
 " a la izquierda, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "N", "paclet:ref/N", "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/N.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9679093e-a42f-425c-af54-ea9ef4486d11"],
 " no gira y ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["U",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"a5ca6f01-7ca3-4634-87b0-fc683c59f245"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"b5870386-aec7-41e8-837a-06c4a7519d51"],
 " da media vuelta. En cada paso de tiempo la hormiga:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3c6d6f1b-de6e-461c-a1ed-0a3ff4693915"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. lee el color ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " de su celda y gira seg\[UAcute]n la letra ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " de la regla,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d3aeb05-7494-48f8-9deb-4cfa1822257e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "2. cambia el color de la celda a ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["c + 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"83adad5a-5351-4d31-9386-3fb82c262684"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"498bdd6c-fb40-4792-ae86-bd3c8c241b04"],
 " (m\[OAcute]dulo el n\[UAcute]mero de colores),"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3c381e74-8f95-4b26-bb8f-1f679c8349a5"],

Cell["3. avanza una celda en su nueva direcci\[OAcute]n.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"92d23cb9-9de2-4a52-bea3-4decc027d588"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "La regla cl\[AAcute]sica es ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RL\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "13099eea-abb2-407d-9a41-9bae39836298"],
 ". Otras conocidas: ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RLR\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "7a666a7e-c4f6-43fd-825c-3f455e17c6e6"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<LLRR\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "f06f31ae-eda6-43f7-9517-e6ddf26ad2e7"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<LRRRRRLLR\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "8956d6c9-4fa2-400b-88c0-00f60be7347d"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RRLLLRLLLRRR\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "f9891dc1-081b-4dcd-900f-464035f1e597"],
 ". Los bordes son peri\[OAcute]dicos. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"20ecb2f6-36b8-42b7-8183-6d558948487e"],

Cell["Estados", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"99f55fb3-411a-49dc-80c4-4b9a3057343f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Con ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " colores, cada celda sin hormiga tiene su color ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["0 \[Ellipsis] n \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"afb447cc-f19f-4350-8835-b8cb21c5bda7"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"e8a5c346-460d-4583-bb80-21beffbfc3f9"],
 ". La celda con la hormiga se distingue sumando ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " veces (direcci\[OAcute]n + 1) a su color, con las direcciones 0 = arriba, \
1 = derecha, 2 = abajo y 3 = izquierda: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"766ffb9d-10df-474c-b833-7a7d0d04ec18"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["0 \[Ellipsis] n \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"69a8787b-45e9-4b91-b584-556276faa37b"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"d241299d-46ea-4f64-a2bb-b37ee5cfc37b"],
 ": color sin hormiga."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ad303839-48df-40e9-b8e8-71bc08b05704"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["n \[Ellipsis] 2n \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"125350b2-1894-4f58-a914-e97696fe16da"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"4a23b91d-8cfb-46d5-bf16-0da2ed38369e"],
 ": hormiga hacia arriba sobre ese color."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"98240433-8ecc-4cc6-a5cd-154cc79cf443"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["2n \[Ellipsis] 3n \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"385d57d3-56a3-4256-a43b-d064b8ed544f"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"c0748d9b-a53a-48aa-b2d6-53746e4b3508"],
 ": hormiga hacia la derecha."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f8a5a7d3-7cea-4d4d-98a1-e8f86219cb0e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["3n \[Ellipsis] 4n \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"1a2776b2-0af4-48da-b590-a6ed64d0968b"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"b4f34eb4-a3bb-4be2-91bf-d718841cb417"],
 ": hormiga hacia abajo."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"29d61df8-9551-43f5-9e3c-bde477d3f7a7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["4n \[Ellipsis] 5n \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"b71eee02-64af-45ce-803d-461d000c8285"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"cfc6138f-c1d8-4161-a3d1-add7b46d829f"],
 ": hormiga hacia la izquierda."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"7dec8991-5c78-445e-8748-a74405f69bf7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Con ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RL\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "98022335-35f0-432e-b792-e72b4cbeb03a"],
 " son 10 estados. Se guarda el espacio despu\[EAcute]s de cada paso, as\
\[IAcute] que la evoluci\[OAcute]n tiene ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["pasos + 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"17e3b80e-f6a1-4d75-a7f4-7af9603b1e9e"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"106444a0-80a6-432b-8913-5c0f48fa68da"],
 " cuadros (el cuadro 0 es la hormiga en su posici\[OAcute]n inicial). "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9eaccfa9-2117-4dd7-b06e-bd82af8ba896"],

Cell["Par\[AAcute]metros", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"35b0e2e8-6331-4453-a3b3-098dddef3075"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Con ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RL\>\""], "InlineWL", "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "4be631dd-886b-4515-8a5e-0dfb9822fbce"],
 " y la hormiga al centro, la fase ca\[OAcute]tica ocupa 45 \[Times] 49 \
celdas antes de que aparezca la autopista (paso ~10 000), y la autopista sale \
por el lado de 49. En 50 \[Times] 50 la hormiga cruza el borde \
peri\[OAcute]dico antes (paso 5 265) y no llega a construir la autopista; con \
100 \[Times] 100 s\[IAcute] se forma y avanza ~10 periodos antes del paso 11 \
000."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c6108a12-a87f-4d9e-ada9-2fc2ee41504e"],

